      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;the-problem&#34;&gt;The problem&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Given the &lt;code&gt;root&lt;/code&gt; of a binary tree, imagine yourself standing on the right side of it, return the values of the nodes you can see ordered from top to bottom.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;examples&#34;&gt;Examples&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Input: root = [1,2,3,null,5,null,4]&#xA;Output: [1,3,4]&#xA;Explanation:&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; id=&#34;zoomCheck-5143c&#34; hidden&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;zoomCheck-5143c&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img class=&#34;zoomCheck&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34; &#xA;            src=&#34;images/tmpd5jn43fs-1.png#center&#34; alt=&#34;alt image&#34; &#xA;             /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Input: root = [1,2,3,4,null,null,null,5]&#xA;Output: [1,3,4,5]&#xA;Explanation:&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; id=&#34;zoomCheck-72c0e&#34; hidden&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;zoomCheck-72c0e&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img class=&#34;zoomCheck&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34; &#xA;            src=&#34;images/tmpkpe40xeh-1.png#center&#34; alt=&#34;alt image&#34; &#xA;             /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Input: root = [1,null,3]&#xA;Output: [1,3]&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Input: root = []&#xA;Output: []&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h4 id=&#34;constraints&#34;&gt;Constraints&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The number of nodes in the tree is in the range [0, 100].&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;-100 &amp;lt;= Node.val &amp;lt;= 100&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;explanation&#34;&gt;Explanation&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;rsquo;s imagine that we have a person on the right side and if we look at the first example, we can see everything on the right side.&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; id=&#34;zoomCheck-7cc78&#34; hidden&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;zoomCheck-7cc78&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img class=&#34;zoomCheck&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34; &#xA;            src=&#34;images/199.png#center&#34; alt=&#34;alt image&#34; &#xA;             /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
